            },
            "reviewBody": "I used bone-in chicken thighs only because that's what I accidentally pulled out of my freezer. I used petite diced tomatoes, seasoned the chicken before coating it in the flour and added some chicken broth. We enjoyed and it's a recipe I would make again.",
